Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.66,0:22:50.26,ED_CHT_S2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}好想讓{\rED_CHS_S2}你{\r}知 這顆心發{\rED_CHS_S2}烫{燙}
